# The steps of hotkeys.script with the key bindings of a Steam installation,
# whose REDALERT.INI holds Windows key codes in [WinHotkeys]. The keys are the
# same ones, so it must show what hotkeys.script shows.
# file: REDALERT.INI steam_hotkeys.ini
# hashes: hotkeys.hashes
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
# Select everything in view, make it team 1, let it go and call it back.
at 500 key E
at 520 shot select_view
at 521 keydown CTRL
at 522 key 1
at 525 keyup CTRL
at 540 shot team_made
at 541 rclick 300 200
at 561 key 1
at 580 shot team_selected
# Remember the view, scatter, and step to the next and the previous unit,
# which centers the view on it.
at 581 keydown CTRL
at 582 key F9
at 585 keyup CTRL
at 591 key X
at 650 shot scattered
at 651 key N
at 670 shot next
at 671 key B
at 690 shot previous
at 691 key F9
at 710 shot bookmark
at 711 key 1
at 712 key HOME
at 730 shot home
# A move order that Stop cuts short, then guard and formation.
at 731 click 250 250
at 760 key S
at 800 shot stopped
at 801 key G
at 802 key F
at 840 shot guard_formation
at 841 key SPACE
at 880 shot options
at 881 quit
